The sample datasets are not the work of this package's authors. Each is listed below with where
it was taken from, what to cite and its license as far as it is known. Each was converted by
scripts/convert-datasets.mjs, which records the exact source file and its SHA-256; the
converted data are changed files, not the originals (node order, encoding and, for the
football network, the corrections listed). To have a dataset removed, open an issue at
https://github.com/graphty-org/graphty-monorepo/issues; removing one means deleting its
src/datasets/<name>/ directory and its entries in src/datasets/catalog.ts and this file.

